    "note": "Enrolled Sub. H.B. 99 (134th GA). Passed House 59-33 (2021-11-17), Senate 23-9 and House concurrence 56-35 (2022-06-01). Struck: the old (D)(1) list wording was reorganised into (a)-(e); existing exemptions for officers, agents, security officers kept. Section 3 appropriation topic call is a judgement."
